[00:10.70]1. Who is like you, O Jehovah,
[00:21.40]High on your heavenly throne?
[00:28.22]How could I ever repay you
[00:34.65]For all of the love you have shown?
[00:42.04]When I look up to the heavens,
[00:48.28]Power and glory I see.
[00:55.08]Who then am I, O Jehovah,
[01:02.01]That you would show favor to me?
[01:04.97](Chorus)
[01:07.93]Jehovah God, please hear the song I sing.
[01:15.69]It’s a song of praise to you.
[01:19.10]You are my God and the Eternal King,
[01:27.60]So I give you what is due;
[01:36.28]All the glory goes to you.
[01:47.52]2. My life is yours, O Jehovah.
[01:53.76]May all I do bring you praise.
[02:00.86]Gladly I’ll speak of your goodness
[02:06.43]And tell of your glorious ways.
[02:14.40]Serving you, Great God, Jehovah,
[02:21.31]Fills me with honor and pride.
[02:28.12]You are my strength and my glory.
[02:34.58]Forever may you be my Guide.
[02:37.50](Chorus)
[02:40.42]Jehovah God, please hear the song I sing.
[02:47.74]It’s a song of praise to you.
[02:52.22]You are my God and the Eternal King,
[03:01.22]So I give you what is due;
[03:08.22]All the glory goes to you.
[03:20.35]3. Oceans and valleys below me,
[03:26.30]Sun, moon, and stars up above
[03:33.40]Fill me with joy and with wonder
[03:39.84]And show me your unending love.
[03:47.90]Majesty, wisdom, and beauty:
[03:53.90]These are the things that I see.
[04:00.67]How could I not give you glory
[04:06.67]For making it all come to be?
[04:09.67](Chorus)
[04:12.67]Jehovah God, please hear the song I sing.
[04:20.92]It’s a song of praise to you.
[04:26.92]You are my God and the Eternal King,
[04:33.92]So I give you what is due;
[04:41.47]All the glory goes to you.